.SH "Constructor & Destructor Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "csmp::Halite::Halite (const double & externaltemperature, const double & externalpressure)"
custom constructor

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
Use only this conctructor\&. \fBHalite\fP computes halite properties as a function of temperature and pressure\&. These are typically computed somewhere outside this class\&. By using const refs to those external variables as constructor argument, \fBHaliteLiquidus\fP is able to decipher their current values when being queried for halite properties\&. Only this constructor is allowed to ensure that functionality, default constructor has been made private\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "csmp::Halite::~Halite ()"
destructor 
